graph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"样式规律 vs 数量规律：样式关注「图形之间怎么变」，数量关注「有多少个」"}]}]}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#eff6ff","borderColor":"#3b82f6","icon":"📊"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"学习建议：","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"样式规律中「求异」和「黑白运算」是最高频的两个考点。九宫格题优先横着看，再竖着看。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '样式规律概述：运算与遍历的识别特征、判断逻辑、考频分布。', category_node.id, CAST('["图形推理", "样式规律", "概述"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xingce_logic_figure_reasoning_pattern", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
